{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hi Maria! It's so good to talk again. A lot has changed since last time. I'm really enjoying my new job. My team has been super encouraging and inspiring."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-d980cc662e825319bc0f7dd9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.357751+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d980cc662e825319bc0f7dd9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d980cc662e825319bc0f7dd9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, glad work is going well! Having a good team is so important. I had a great experience last weekend hiking with my church friends - it was great to be surrounded by supportive people and to enjoy nature. Felt so refreshing!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-8ebf2547fef7db2b6c96884d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.376061+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8ebf2547fef7db2b6c96884d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8ebf2547fef7db2b6c96884d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sounds like you had a great time! What inspired you to go on the hike?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-8415c7044805c4d9707bf69f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.388181+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8415c7044805c4d9707bf69f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8415c7044805c4d9707bf69f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I wanted to make connections, laugh together and take in nature's beauty. Uplifting!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-88f307045a4039dd5b225f76", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.400001+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "88f307045a4039dd5b225f76", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "88f307045a4039dd5b225f76", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow Maria, it sounds like you had a great time! Connecting with good people and taking in the beautiful views really boosts your mood. It's important to make time for yourself and find those special moments of joy. What were some of your best bits from the hike?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-4509c85e6a4a0d95f0e13aec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.410000+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4509c85e6a4a0d95f0e13aec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4509c85e6a4a0d95f0e13aec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! Reaching the top was amazing - the view was breathtaking! Seeing how huge the world is made me feel like I'm part of something special - gave me a real sense of peace."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-6227b4aa75bb7e1024369f74", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.424436+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6227b4aa75bb7e1024369f74", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6227b4aa75bb7e1024369f74", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, that sounds incredible! It's amazing how nature can make us feel so small and yet so connected to something greater. Do you have any plans for your next adventure yet?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-a1109116460299f4620ac46b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.438641+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1109116460299f4620ac46b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1109116460299f4620ac46b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Gonna explore more and volunteer at shelters next month. Can't wait!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-9ddc6e3d822dab48737d6939", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.450757+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ddc6e3d822dab48737d6939", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ddc6e3d822dab48737d6939", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Woohoo, Maria! Super pumped for your next adventure and for putting your positivity out there. Keep up the awesome work!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-ee514668ac624f9656f709e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.461455+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee514668ac624f9656f709e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee514668ac624f9656f709e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! Is it a martial arts place or a yoga studio? It looks awesome!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-75f7de13c0980a64b239ddfb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.472609+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "75f7de13c0980a64b239ddfb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "75f7de13c0980a64b239ddfb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yup, it's a yoga studio I go to often. The vibe is really chill and the instructors are awesome."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-2a63bd730f8cec9f768754e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.485720+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a63bd730f8cec9f768754e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a63bd730f8cec9f768754e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Cool, John! That definitely makes the workout experience more enjoyable. Do they offer a variety of classes?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-772c86fefcb8a53cae78511e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.497721+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "772c86fefcb8a53cae78511e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "772c86fefcb8a53cae78511e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, they offer a a bunch, like yoga, kickboxing, and circuit training. It keeps things interesting!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-1c9d771b4f44336960e19887", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.508899+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1c9d771b4f44336960e19887", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1c9d771b4f44336960e19887", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Cool, John! Trying new classes sounds like a fun way to switch up your exercise routine - I should give it a go!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-dd269e181f4eeaaec96c2053", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.520037+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dd269e181f4eeaaec96c2053", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dd269e181f4eeaaec96c2053", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria! Trying new stuff is a great way to push yourself and mix things up. Let me know if you need any suggestions!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-594fa02fc553222f9e0ab415", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.530291+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "594fa02fc553222f9e0ab415", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "594fa02fc553222f9e0ab415", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Looks fun! What other classes have you done?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-697f60ac87e87147bbe9d51a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.541585+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "697f60ac87e87147bbe9d51a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "697f60ac87e87147bbe9d51a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've done weight training so far too. It was challenging but peaceful, kinda like yoga."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-28f5f5ea9f852335bd9b2f16", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.550599+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "28f5f5ea9f852335bd9b2f16", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "28f5f5ea9f852335bd9b2f16", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! That's great. Yoga is a great way to relax and concentrate, and joining a new class might be a good option."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-41/session_25-59f8f5e586837e7af5d13587", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:07:12.560324+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "59f8f5e586837e7af5d13587", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "59f8f5e586837e7af5d13587", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
